{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "title": "行政手続き申請状況（令和8年度）",
    "locale": "ja",
    "description": "行政手続きの申請件数を区分別・月次に集計し、当月の総数と合わせて示すダッシュボード。",
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-08",
    "sourceNote": "建築指導課ほか各課の申請受付簿を集計（applications_r8.xlsx「申請状況」シート）。速報値のため、後日の取下げ・再申請により確定値と差が生じることがあります。",
    "summary": "令和8年度上半期の申請は総数351件。区分別では建築確認が128件で最多、次いで廃棄物処理63件、農地転用47件。月次では4月の51件から7月の70件まで増加した後8月に44件へ落ち込み、9月は66件で持ち直している。"
  },
  "theme": { "tokens": "@digital-go-jp/design-tokens@2.0.1", "palette": "guidebook-blue" },
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "apps",
      "kind": "file",
      "format": "xlsx",
      "ref": { "name": "applications_r8.xlsx", "sheet": "申請状況" }
    }
  ],
  "queries": [
    {
      "id": "q-category",
      "source": "apps",
      "sql": "SELECT category, COUNT(*) AS count FROM apps GROUP BY category"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-monthly",
      "source": "apps",
      "sql": "SELECT month, COUNT(*) AS count FROM apps GROUP BY month ORDER BY month"
    },
    { "id": "q-total", "source": "apps", "sql": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS count FROM apps" }
  ],
  "charts": [
    {
      "id": "app-category",
      "type": "bar",
      "encoding": { "x": "category", "y": "count" },
      "query": "q-category",
      "options": { "title": "区分別申請件数" }
    },
    {
      "id": "app-monthly",
      "type": "line",
      "encoding": { "x": "month", "y": "count" },
      "query": "q-monthly",
      "options": { "title": "月次申請件数推移" }
    },
    {
      "id": "app-total",
      "type": "stat",
      "encoding": { "value": "count" },
      "query": "q-total",
      "options": { "title": "今月の申請総数" }
    }
  ],
  "layout": {
    "grid": "guidebook-12col",
    "items": [
      { "chart": "app-category", "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      { "chart": "app-monthly", "x": 6, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      { "chart": "app-total", "x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 4, "h": 2 }
    ]
  }
}
